  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// The north arrow a plan needs is a `|sketch|` define — SPEC 24 reserves the</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// type, the pen already draws it. It rides the balcony's empty south end,</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// where sheet chrome costs the plan no margin and reads as no fixture.</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">sketch</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">north</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span>
